  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0988eaa2e63e18e",
      "translationZh": "简而言之：Daggr 是一个全新的开源 Python 库，用于构建将 Gradio 应用、ML 模型和自定义函数连接起来的 AI 工作流。它会自动生成一个可视化画布，让你可以查看中间输出、重新运行单个步骤，并管理复杂流水线的状态，而这一切只需几行 Python 代码！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a9360e0212a4d173",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ea2b8a878841df59",
      "translationZh": "背景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d00eca1bae674280",
      "translationZh": "快速入门",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4fe04d0cd653db4c",
      "translationZh": "分享你的工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "faae3dddf9c6e041",
      "translationZh": "使用不同节点的端到端示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "759f4c0213571add",
      "translationZh": "后续步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ea2b8a878841df59",
      "translationZh": "背景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27f43db72af450f9",
      "translationZh": "如果你构建过结合多个模型或处理步骤的 AI 应用，就会知道其中的痛点：串联 API 调用、调试流水线，以及难以追踪中间结果。当一个包含 10 个步骤的工作流在第 5 步出错时，你往往不得不重新运行整个流程，只为弄清楚发生了什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11bd27821b660258",
      "translationZh": "大多数开发者要么编写脆弱且难以调试的脚本，要么转向重量级编排平台，而这些平台是为生产环境中的流水线设计的，并非为快速实验而打造。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bad9f5c4a9aca479",
      "translationZh": "我们一直在开发 Daggr，以解决我们在构建 AI 演示和工作流时反复遇到的问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1993dc911134ffd",
      "translationZh": "可视化代码流程：在基于节点的 GUI 编辑器中，你需要通过可视化操作拖动并连接节点，而 Daggr 与之不同，采用代码优先的方式。你用 Python 定义工作流，系统就会自动生成可视化画布。这意味着你可以兼得两者的优势：既能对代码进行版本控制，又能直观地检查中间输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88c07bfb7eceee44",
      "translationZh": "检查并重新运行任意步骤：可视化画布不只是用来展示的。你可以检查任意节点的输出、修改输入，并重新运行单个步骤，而不必执行整条流水线。当你调试一个包含 10 个步骤的工作流，而只有第 7 步运行异常时，这一点极其有用。你甚至可以提供“备用节点”——用另一个模型或 Space 替换原有的模型或 Space——来构建具备容错能力的工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83a214a12afbfa75",
      "translationZh": "一流的 Gradio 集成：由于 Daggr 由 Gradio 团队开发，因此它可以与 Gradio Spaces 无缝协作。指定任意公开（或私有）的 Space，就可以将其用作工作流中的节点。无需适配器，无需封装层——只需引用 Space 名称和 API 端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d05021ea5349f4a",
      "translationZh": "状态持久化：Daggr 会自动保存工作流状态、输入值、缓存结果和画布位置，让你可以从上次停下的地方继续。使用“sheets”可在同一个应用中维护多个工作区。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d00eca1bae674280",
      "translationZh": "快速入门",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a856d4555c8df579",
      "translationZh": "使用 pip 或 uv 安装 daggr，它只需要 Python 3.10 或更高版本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "940c941fc5f904da",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个生成图像并移除其背景的简单示例。查看该 Space 底部的 API 参考文档，了解它接受哪些输入以及返回哪些输出。在这个示例中，Space 会同时返回原始图像和编辑后的图像，因此我们只返回编辑后的图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a2f73bcd3688fff",
      "translationZh": "就这么简单。运行这个脚本，就会自动启动一个在端口 7860 上提供服务的可视化画布，同时生成一个可分享的实时链接。画布会显示两个相互连接的节点，每一步都有可修改的输入和可查看的输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "691ec21e6ddab488",
      "translationZh": "节点类型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ac1f8e2514abca6",
      "translationZh": "Daggr 支持三种类型的节点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8e60b6335d54003",
      "translationZh": "GradioNode 调用 Gradio Space API 端点或在本地提供服务的 Gradio 应用。传入 run_locally=True 后，Daggr 会自动克隆该 Space，创建隔离的虚拟环境，并启动应用。如果本地执行失败，它会平稳回退到远程 API。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e26e5a49c5e711a5",
      "translationZh": "FnNode — 运行自定义 Python 函数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae515061689fd3ce",
      "translationZh": "InferenceNode — 通过 Hugging Face Inference Providers 调用模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4fe04d0cd653db4c",
      "translationZh": "分享你的工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a83715491afe2f08",
      "translationZh": "通过 Gradio 的隧道功能生成一个公开 URL：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7e037e97b945114",
      "translationZh": "如需永久托管，可使用 Gradio SDK 将其部署到 Hugging Face Spaces——只需将 daggr 添加到你的 requirements.txt 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "faae3dddf9c6e041",
      "translationZh": "使用不同节点的端到端示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2f36305825f6100",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们将开发一个接收图像并生成 3D 资产的应用。此演示可在 daggr 0.4.3 上运行。步骤如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0657bba41a5d4573",
      "translationZh": "获取一张图像并移除背景：为此，我们将克隆 BiRefNet Space 并在本地运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6c69426bfba079a",
      "translationZh": "缩小图像以提高效率：我们将使用 FnNode 编写一个简单的函数来完成此操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b04f7551149a1186",
      "translationZh": "生成一张具有 3D 资产风格的图像，以获得更好的效果：我们将使用 InferenceNode，通过 Inference Providers 调用 Flux.2-klein-4B 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bbe1628dac8fbe03",
      "translationZh": "将输出图像传给 3D 生成器：我们会将输出图像发送到托管在 Spaces 上的 Trellis.2 Space。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c12f3cf7facfc83",
      "translationZh": "在本地运行的 Space 可能会在应用文件中将模型移至 CUDA（使用 to.(“cuda”)）或 ZeroGPU。要禁用这一行为，让模型在 CPU 上运行（适用于没有 NVIDIA GPU 的设备），请先创建你想使用的 Space 的副本，再将其克隆到本地。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "703be023c44d0de4",
      "translationZh": "生成的图如下所示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a4b2fe7fc51a510",
      "translationZh": "让我们来编写第一步，也就是背景移除器。我们会克隆这个 Space 并在本地运行。这个 Space 在 CPU 上运行，运行一次大约需要 13 秒。如果你有 NVIDIA GPU，可以换用这个应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed8300490a277556",
      "translationZh": "第二步，我们需要编写一个辅助函数来缩小图像，并将其传给 FnNode。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2a6ec8d504293ba",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们可以传入该函数来初始化 FnNode。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae471330e04b0643",
      "translationZh": "接下来，我们将编写使用 Flux 模型的 InferenceNode。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cfa8ae07de63ec3",
      "translationZh": "将使用 InferenceNode 的应用部署到 Hugging Face Spaces 时，请使用细粒度的 Hugging Face 访问令牌，并且仅启用“Make calls to Inference Providers”选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33c49922f401b77b",
      "translationZh": "最后一个节点通过查询 Hugging Face 上的 Trellis.2 Space 来生成 3D 内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ddeb99c5b1cd299",
      "translationZh": "将它们串联起来并启动应用，就像下面这样简单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce14d605b43d42f2",
      "translationZh": "你可以在这个 Space 中找到正在运行的完整示例；要在本地运行，你只需获取 app.py、安装依赖项，并登录 Hugging Face Hub。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "759f4c0213571add",
      "translationZh": "后续步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94011b7995d22d6e",
      "translationZh": "Daggr 目前处于测试阶段，并且刻意保持轻量。不同版本之间的 API 可能会发生变化，虽然我们会在本地持久化保存工作流状态，但更新期间仍有可能丢失数据。如果你有功能请求或发现了错误，请在这里提交 issue。我们期待你的反馈！在社交媒体上与 Gradio 分享你的 daggr 工作流，就有机会获得精选展示。点击这里查看所有精选作品。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
